00:20:22.425 --> 00:20:26.326
♬〜

00:20:26.326 --> 00:20:29.227
Shun-san.
¿Sí?

00:20:29.227 --> 00:20:34.633
Tengo que irme pronto
Kato-san...

00:20:34.633 --> 00:20:38.260
